# The part the driver actually has to work on: CTRL read-only, so no reset
# ever happens, and the receiver is already running against somebody else's
# ring. Both measured/inferred from Damian's I219-V on 2026-08-13.
#
# -e1000-inject 1 because the judge is a RECEIVED FRAME. No register on this
# path distinguishes a working receiver from a ring programmed underneath a
# live one, which is the whole reason this test exists.
-e1000-inject 1
-e1000-ctrl-ro
-e1000-preconfigured